* Empty migration `fix_users_table` created — no schema change could be inferred from the name `FixUsersTable`, so its `up()` is unimplemented and `$ cargo loco db migrate` will panic until you write it. Names Loco does understand: CreateMovies, AddNameToUsers, RemoveNameFromUsers, AddUserRefToPosts, RenameTitleToNameOnMovies, CreateJoinTableUsersAndGroups.
